{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EliasFanoGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V5EdgesV","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph\/Edges-swift.struct","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Every edge in row-major order; the position of an edge is its index.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule\/eliasfanograph\/edges-swift.property"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph\/edges-swift.property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule","doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"EliasFanoGraphModule","modules":[{"name":"EliasFanoGraphModule"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V","text":"EliasFanoGraph","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V5EdgesV","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"edges","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V5edgesAC5EdgesVvp","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph.swift#L456","fileName":"EliasFanoGraph.swift"}},"references":{"doc://EliasFanoGraphModule/documentation/EliasFanoGraphModule/EliasFanoGraph":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An immutable directed graph on the vertices "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<n"},{"type":"text","text":" whose rows of successors are Elias–Fano"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"coded (Elias 1974, Fano 1971; Vigna, “Quasi-succinct indices”, WSDM 2013), as WebGraph’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EFGraph"},{"type":"text","text":" stores them: each row’s ascending targets split into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"l"},{"type":"text","text":" low bits, packed, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"high parts written in unary, so a row of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"d"},{"type":"text","text":" targets below "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"type":"text","text":" takes about "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"d · (2 + log₂(n\/d))"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bits instead of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"64 d"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"EliasFanoGraph","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EliasFanoGraph","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule\/eliasfanograph","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EliasFanoGraph","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://EliasFanoGraphModule/documentation/EliasFanoGraphModule/EliasFanoGraph/edges-swift.property":{"abstract":[{"text":"Every edge in row-major order; the position of an edge is its index.","type":"text"}],"title":"edges","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph\/edges-swift.property","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule\/eliasfanograph\/edges-swift.property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EliasFanoGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:20EliasFanoGraphModule0abC0V5EdgesV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://EliasFanoGraphModule/documentation/EliasFanoGraphModule":{"title":"EliasFanoGraphModule","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule"},"doc://EliasFanoGraphModule/documentation/EliasFanoGraphModule/EliasFanoGraph/Edges-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph\/Edges-swift.struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The edges of a graph, or a contiguous run of them. Positions are edge indices. Iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decodes each row once, O(1) amortized per edge; subscripting one position is O(log n +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-degree), so prefer iteration to index loops.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule\/eliasfanograph\/edges-swift.struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Edges","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"EliasFanoGraph.Edges"}}}